WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
AMIT CHAUDHRY: We are seeing
more and more enterprises

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.020
embracing a hybrid
and now increasingly

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:07.600
multi-cloud strategy
for their applications.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.320
Made on prem and cloud, or
even deploying components

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.810
between multiple cloud
renders, developer

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:17.680
needs tools and agility to
embrace hybrid environments,

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.110
so they can handle
real-time scale that's

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:21.940
available across the world.

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:25.270
DataStax is a master list,
active everywhere database

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:28.900
built on Apache Cassandra and
designed for Hybrid Cloud.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.480
DSE Active Everywhere
architecture

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:34.990
enables customers to build a
consistent operational data

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:39.040
layer across on premise,
hybrid cloud, and multi-cloud,

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.280
thereby eliminating data
silos and accelerating

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:44.350
hybrid multi-cloud deployments.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.390
DataStax Enterprise
is a foundation

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:50.050
for building highly distributed
real-time applications that

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.840
need infinite
scalability, no downtime,

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.850
and global availability
in any cloud.

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:58.420
And now, with Google
Cloud, DataStax

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:01.990
can provide more flexible ways
to create seamless enterprise

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:04.540
clusters across
different regions using

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.300
VMs and Kubernetes deployments.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:10.930
Active Everywhere capability
of DataStax Enterprise,

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:13.540
supported with Google's
global network,

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.480
enables real-time
applications across the globe.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:19.780
But the power of Google Cloud
for DSE doesn't stop at VMs

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:21.020
and deployments.

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:24.650
It's also about security
at all layers of the cloud.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.440
It's also about manageability.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.030
Google Cloud
provides the leading

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:30.910
managed production-ready
environment for containers.

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:33.670
And it's also about
the network backbone

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:36.490
that Google has of
thousands of miles of fiber

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:39.260
optic cable that make
multi-region data stack

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:42.430
deployment much easier
than other clouds.

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.040
With GKE on premise,
our customers

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:48.700
get the Google Kubernetes
Engine experience directly

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:50.230
in their data center.

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:54.430
GKE is production-ready
and reliable for DSE

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:58.120
to deploy either on
premise or in GCP,

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:01.720
therefore providing customers
a very strong and efficient

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.850
hybrid cloud solution,
something that

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.070
enhances the DataStax
hybrid storing

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:07.840
that customers need today.

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.330
Now, like most
companies, DataStax

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.760
wants to find the
most customers that we

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.350
can help with their offering.

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:17.980
And for this, we can
turn to GCP Marketplace.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:20.320
This marketplace
allows developers

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.510
to find the solutions
for their projects

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:26.920
with AI-powered recommendations,
in-product marketplace windows,

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.810
and available free trials.

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:32.770
With just a few clicks, you
can get DataStax Enterprise

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:34.780
deployed quickly
to your project,

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:37.450
